{"3419120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DEVIL'S WAY: BOHEMIAN", "steam_appid": 3419120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEVIL'S WAY: BOHEMIAN</strong> pushes the boundaries of dark humor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of James DUD, a down-and-out, aimless main character trapped in a surreal dystopia governed by a malevolent AI. In a world where your choices dictate your survival, every door you open brings unpredictable consequences, chaotic corridors, and absurd psychological traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frequently Asked Questions:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is there violence or profanity in the game?</strong> Plenty of it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is there dark humor with lots of pop culture references?</strong> More than you could ever want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will it make you laugh until you cry?</strong> If you know how to have fun in games, absolutely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Choices:</strong> Face bizarre A/B dilemmas controlled by a ruthless AI. No option is truly safe, and every door hides a completely different scenario.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419120/extras/b0b696cc24cef0144ad37b5073d2c91a.poster.avif?t=1788277105\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419120/extras/b0b696cc24cef0144ad37b5073d2c91a.webm?t=1788277105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Survival &amp; Action:</strong> Don't just 